ration points and rolling-circle geometry"'::jsonb, '"An unrelated auxiliary plane"'::jsonb, '"Appropriate RF, clear dimensioning and scale notation"'::jsonb, '"Only line colour"'::jsonb, '"Omit dimensions because a scale exists"'::jsonb, '"Isometric view without measurements"'::jsonb, '"All circles always draw as ellipses"'::jsonb, '"Projection foreshortens dimensions when the circle is inclined to the projection plane"'::jsonb, '"The scale ratio changes non-uniformly in every view"'::jsonb, '"The real circle changes shape"'::jsonb, '"Remove all line distinctions"'::jsonb, '"Use dimensions for every edge"'::jsonb, '"Use centre lines as outlines"'::jsonb, '"Use continuous thick object lines for visible edges and dashed lines for hidden edges"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

